OL,3,GNEWSAMum raises awareness over newborn
OL,4,Ababy's stroke
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother whose newborn daughter
OL,7,Fsuffered a stroke is raising awareness
OL,8,Fof the life-changing impact the
OL,9,Fcondition can have at any age.
OL,11,FMaya, from Goole, East Yorkshire, had a
OL,12,Fstroke in early 2024 when she was just
OL,13,Fthree days old.
OL,15,FNearly three years later, her mother,
OL,16,FZoe Frodsham, has shared the challenges
OL,17,Fher family has faced since, hoping
OL,18,Ftheir story will offer reassurance to
OL,19,Fothers in a similar situation.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
