OL,3,GNEWSAMum raises awareness over newborn
OL,4,Ababy's stroke
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Because she can walk and talk, people
OL,7,Fassume she is fine," Zoe said. "But
OL,8,Fbrain injuries are not always visible.
OL,9,FProgress does not erase what happened."
